Robert Pattinson isn&#x2019;t the only A-lister who&#x2019;s appeared in multiple massive movie franchises.

Adam Driver starred as the lightsaber-wielding antagonist Kylo Ren in the &#x201C;Star Wars&#x201D; trilogy and will don a cape once more as Dr. Nathaniel Essex, aka Mister Sinister &#x2014; a hyperintelligent, shape-shifting telepath and the main villain in Marvel&#x2019;s upcoming &#x201C;X-Men&#x201D; reboot directed by Jake Schreier. And, during his appearance on &#x201C; Late Night with Seth Meyers &#x201D; Monday to promote the James Gray film &#x201C;Paper Tiger,&#x201D; the Oscar-nominated actor was asked a series of questions by the talk-show host about the upcoming superhero movie. blogherads.adq.push(function () { blogherads .defineSlot( 'medrec', 'gpt-variety-article-mid-article-uid0' ) .setTargeting( 'pos', ["mid-article1","mid-articleX","mid","mid-article"] ) .setTargeting( 'viewable', 'yes' ) .setSubAdUnitPath("ros\/mid-article") .addSize([[300,250],[2,2],[300,251],[2,4],[4,2],[320,480],[620,366],[300,450]]) .setClsOptimization("minsize") ; }); Related Stories WWE, Disney Team for 'Avengers: Doomsday'-Themed Worlds Collide, John Cena Classic UFC's Event Sellout Spree Powers TKO Q3 Earnings

First, Meyers held up a photo of Mister Sinister &#x2014; body suit, sharp collar, shredded cape, makeup and all &#x2014; to which Driver quipped, &#x201C;[Looks] just like me. This is 6 a.m. when my daughter wakes me up.&#x201D;

He then asked the &#x201C;Girls&#x201D; and &#x201C;Marriage Story&#x201D; performer how familiar he was with Mister Sinister prior to joining the cast. &#x201C;Yes. Not to the degree &#x2014; I was more aware of Magneto. I was a big X-Men fan&#x2026; My cousin Tony would come over, and he made these Sabretooth costume things with the yellow rubber gloves and put toothpicks out the side, and I would dress as Wolverine.&#x201D;

Driver added that his 10-year-old son, who&#x2019;d previously expressed little to no interest in watching his films, is finally looking forward to one of them. &#x201C;My son is actually excited about &#x2018;X-Men.&#x2019; Plus, at this point, he&#x2019;s getting older and hasn&#x2019;t seen anything that I&#x2019;ve been in, but he&#x2019;s been to sets. He wants to see me in something,&#x201D; offered Driver. blogherads.adq.push(function () { blogherads .defineSlot( 'medrec', 'gpt-dsk-tab-mid-article2-uid1' ) .setTargeting( 'pos', ["mid","mid-article2","mid-articleX"] ) .setTargeting( 'viewable', 'yes' ) .setSubAdUnitPath("ros\/mid-article2") .addSize([[320,480],[300,250],[300,251],[2,4],[4,2],[620,366],[300,450]]) .setClsOptimization("minsize") ; });

Marvel Studios honcho Kevin Feige admitted he&#x2019;d been courting Driver for quite some time before he finally caved with &#x201C;X-Men,&#x201D; though the actor would usually engage in discussions with Marvel before politely declining. &#x201C;It&#x2019;s no secret we&#x2019;d like to [work with Adam],&#x201D; Feige told the &#x201C;Happy Sad Confused&#x201D; podcast. &#x201C;But it&#x2019;s a tradition to Zoom with him and then he passes. That&#x2019;s a long-lived tradition. He couldn&#x2019;t be more cordial. He is usually upfront about how he is feeling.&#x201D;

Schreier&#x2019;s upcoming &#x201C;X-Men&#x201D; reboot will see Driver square off against Sadie Sink as Jean Grey, Inde Navarrette as Rogue, Kit Connor as Cyclops, Maya Boyd as Storm, Asa Germann as Angel and Christopher Abbott as Charles Xavier/Professor X. The film will hit theaters May 5, 2028.

Hila Klein is officially exiting the &#x201C; H3 Podcast &#x201D; a month after it was revealed that her co-host and husband, Ethan Klein, had been having a six-month affair. The news follows Hila&#x2019;s October announcement that the show would be on an &#x201C;indefinite hiatus&#x201D; amid the scandal's fallout.

On Monday, Hila posted on the show&#x2019;s Instagram announcing that she had made &#x201C;the difficult decision to stop working on the new show.&#x201D; &#x201C;I truly tried with every ounce of strength I had to make this work,&#x201D; she wrote. &#x201C;But after everything that has happened, I&#x2019;ve come to realize that I can&#x2019;t continue down this path while also giving myself the space I need to heal and protect my mental health.&#x201D; blogherads.adq.push(function () { blogherads .defineSlot( 'medrec', 'gpt-variety-article-mid-article-uid0' ) .setTargeting( 'pos', ["mid-article1","mid-articleX","mid","mid-article"] ) .setTargeting( 'viewable', 'yes' ) .setSubAdUnitPath("ros\/mid-article") .addSize([[300,250],[2,2],[300,251],[2,4],[4,2],[320,480],[620,366],[300,450]]) .setClsOptimization("minsize") ; }); Related Stories 'Gondhal' Director Santosh Davakhar Talks Creating India's 2027 Oscar Entry, the Films That Inspired Him and More Super Bowl 2027 and Jay-Z Halftime Show to Screen in Imax Theaters

She continued: &#x201C;I&#x2019;m devastated that things have come to this. I love this community we&#x2019;ve built together so much, and I love the crew like my own family. Walking away from something that has been such a huge part of my life is incredibly painful.&#x201D; &#x201C;I will miss you all more than I can put into words,&#x201D; she concluded.

When Ethan&#x2019;s affair was made public, the podcast&#x2019;s production team unanimously agreed to cut ties with the host, issuing a statement that read: &#x201C;We stand with Hila and will support her every step of the way. We&#x2019;re disgusted by Ethan&#x2019;s actions and the hurt he has caused. We all deserved better: Hila, us, and you.&#x201D;

&#x201C;We are all shocked, angry, and heartbroken to learn about Ethan&#x2019;s ongoing affair,&#x201D; the team's statement continued. &#x201C;As soon as we found out, we all agreed: we would not continue working with Ethan involved or profiting in any way. We don&#x2019;t yet know what that means for the future. There&#x2019;s a lot to work through, and we wish we had more answers for you.&#x201D; blogherads.adq.push(function () { blogherads .defineSlot( 'medrec', 'gpt-dsk-tab-mid-article2-uid1' ) .setTargeting( 'pos', ["mid","mid-article2","mid-articleX"] ) .setTargeting( 'viewable', 'yes' ) .setSubAdUnitPath("ros\/mid-article2") .addSize([[320,480],[300,250],[300,251],[2,4],[4,2],[620,366],[300,450]]) .setClsOptimization("minsize") ; });

